# Cylindrical scoring test: same geometry as 00_minimal but with Geometry Cyl

Geometry Cyl
    Name MyCyl
    R   0.0    5.0   1     # 5 radial bins, 1 cm each
    Z   0.0   20.0  200   # 200 depth bins, 1 mm each

Output
         Filename NB_cyl.dat
         Fileformat TEXT
         Geo MyCyl
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Fluence
